{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_81_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_81","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_81_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_81","textTraditional":"十有八年春王正月，宋公、曹伯、衛人、邾人伐齊。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_81_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_81","textTraditional":"夏，師救齊。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_81_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_81","textTraditional":"五月戊寅，宋師及齊師戰于甗。齊師敗績。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_81_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_81","textTraditional":"狄救齊。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_81_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_81","textTraditional":"秋八月丁亥，葬齊桓公。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_81_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_81","textTraditional":"冬，邢人，狄人伐衛。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_81_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_81","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_81_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_81","textTraditional":"十八年春，宋襄公以諸侯伐齊。三月，齊人殺無虧。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_81_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_81","textTraditional":"鄭伯始朝于楚，楚子賜之金，既而悔之，與之盟曰：「無以鑄兵。」故以鑄三鐘。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_81_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_81","textTraditional":"齊人將立孝公，不勝四公子之徒，遂與宋人戰。夏五月，宋敗齊師于甗，立孝公而還。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_81_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_81","textTraditional":"秋八月，葬齊桓公。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_81_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_81","textTraditional":"冬，邢人、狄人伐衛，圍菟圃。衛侯以國讓父兄子弟及朝眾，曰：「苟能治之，燬請從焉。」眾不可，而後師于訾婁。狄師還。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_81_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_81","textTraditional":"梁伯益其國而不能實也，命曰新里，秦取之。","sentenceOrder":14}],"overrides":{}}